d 'ESIZEREG': module for calculating effect size based on a k-level linear regression coefficient
d
d  esizereg works with a categorical coef_name of 2 or more levels
d and reports an omnibus Cohen's f, the weighted root-mean-square
d of each level's standardized distance from the adjusted grand
d (pooled) mean, and a per-level table of Cohen's d or Hedges's g
d comparing each level's adjusted mean to the adjusted grand mean,
d each with a noncentral-t-based confidence interval.  esizereg
d also reports an equivalent eta-squared for Cohen's f, and with
d the pwcompare option, esizereg additionally reports Cohen's
d d/Hedges's g, with confidence intervals, for every pairwise
d comparison among the levels of coef_name. 
d
d KW: effect size
d KW: Cohen’s d
d KW: k-samples
d KW: linear regression
d KW: standardized mean difference
d
d Requires: Stata version 11
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260820
d
d Author: Ariel Linden, Linden Consulting Group, LLC
d Support: email alinden@@lindenconsulting.org
d
f esizereg.ado
f esizereg.sthlp
f esizeregi.ado
f esizeregi.sthlp
